    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Everyone signed → the deal gets the evidence\n\nThe **AllSign Trigger** registers a webhook in your AllSign account and fires on `document.completed`. This branch finds the deal by contract ID, downloads the signed PDF and the **NOM-151 certificate** (Mexican legal timestamp), uploads both to HubSpot Files, attaches them to the deal as a note and marks the contract as **signed**.\n\nYour AllSign API key needs the `webhook:read`, `webhook:write` and `webhook:delete` scopes for the trigger to register and clean up.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "10371405-e149-5269-b010-da9e6ade20b0",
      "name": "Note 12",
