    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Daily nudge to whoever hasn't signed\n\nEvery morning this branch takes the deals whose contract is still **sent**, asks AllSign which signers are pending and sends each one a reminder (email or WhatsApp, same channel as the invitation).\n\nAllSign allows one reminder per signer every 4 hours and 10 API calls per minute — that's why reminders go one at a time with a short pause, and a rejected reminder never stops the run.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fd54f484-825a-559f-9eb3-cb590d05f40a",
